    "After two weeks of logged meals and a few weigh-ins in Health, Popote compares your weight trend with what you ate and adjusts your targets. Checked every week.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Après deux semaines de repas notés et quelques pesées dans Santé, Popote compare la tendance de ton poids à ce que tu as mangé et ajuste tes objectifs. Vérifié chaque semaine."
          }
        }
      }
    },
